WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Measure. Describe historical fire area, perimeter, date and compactness.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Select. Flag unusual profiles, then choose a case using the explicit sorting rule.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Discover. Search Sentinel-2 near the case in a bounded date window.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
